# 约定(2026-09-23 重写, 对齐 api/search/v1 的 proto):
#   直连 = http://{host}:{port}, 身份由 x-md-global-user-id 头模拟网关注入;
#   网关 = {gateway_scheme}://{gateway_host}(LAN) 或 https://{public_gateway_host}(公网), 带 Authorization: Bearer {token}。
#   变量在 http-client.env.json(dev)。host 用 [::1]: 127.0.0.1:30001/30002/30003 被 GoLand/WebStorm/JCEF 占着。

### healthz(details.elasticsearch 必须 ok)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/healthz
Content-Type: application/json

### Search(直连; ES 走 es-dev.apikv.com 只读 key, 由 bootstrap 提供)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/search.v1.SearchService/Search
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "iphone"}

### Search 中文分词(IK)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/search.v1.SearchService/Search
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "精华"}

### 旧客户端兼容: index 字段由服务端忽略
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/search.v1.SearchService/Search
Content-Type: application/json

{"index": "legacy-or-untrusted-index", "name": "iphone"}

### Search(LAN 网关)
POST {{gateway_scheme}}://{{gateway_host}}/search.v1.SearchService/Search
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "iphone"}
